---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import {
  siteConfig,
  homeUrl,
  siteHost,
  renderTemplate,
  legalUpdatedLabel,
} from '../lib/site';

const { appName, contactDisplay: contact } = siteConfig;

const sections = [
  { id: 'overview', label: 'Overview' },
  { id: 'analytics', label: 'Analytics and Histats' },
  { id: 'cookies', label: 'Cookies' },
  { id: 'logs', label: 'Hosting logs' },
  { id: 'advertising', label: 'Advertising' },
  { id: 'choices', label: 'Your choices' },
  { id: 'children', label: 'Children' },
  { id: 'changes', label: 'Changes' },
  { id: 'contact', label: 'Contact' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title={siteConfig.pages.privacy.title}
  description={renderTemplate(siteConfig.pages.privacy.description)}
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lede="What is collected when you visit this page, why it is collected, and how to limit it."
  updated={legalUpdatedLabel}
  sections={sections}
>
  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>
    This policy explains what happens to information when you use {siteHost}. The site is a
    static download and information page for the {appName} Android app. It has no user accounts, no
    comments, no contact form and no checkout.
  </p>
  <p>
    The policy covers this website only. It does not cover the {appName} app itself, the external
    service that serves the APK, or any service you open from a link on this page. Those services have
    their own privacy policies.
  </p>

  <h2 id="analytics">Analytics and Histats</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses Histats, a third-party web statistics service, on every page. The Histats site
    ID used here is <strong>{siteConfig.analytics.histatsId}</strong>. The script runs for every
    visitor and is not placed behind a consent banner or a delayed loader.
  </p>
  <p>
    Histats records page views and visit information. That can include your IP address, approximate
    location derived from it, browser and device type, operating system, referring page, the pages
    you open and the time of the visit. Histats may also set cookies or similar identifiers in your
    browser. The reports are used to understand traffic, see which pages are useful and keep the
    site working.
  </p>
  <p>
    Histats is an independent service. Its own privacy policy and retention practices apply to the
    data it receives. This site does not combine Histats data with any other information and does
    not use it to identify you by name.
  </p>

  <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    Histats may place first-party or third-party cookies, or read identifiers already stored by it,
    to count visits and distinguish returning browsers. This site does not set login, session, shopping
    or preference cookies of its own.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can delete or block cookies in your browser settings. Blocking requests to
    <code>s10.histats.com</code> and <code>sstatic1.histats.com</code> stops the tracker from
    loading. Blocking cookies may also affect how visits are counted, but it does not affect your
    ability to read this page or download the app.
  </p>

  <h2 id="logs">Hosting logs</h2>
  <p>
    The site is delivered through Cloudflare and a static site hosting provider. Those providers may
    keep standard request logs, including IP address, requested URL, timestamp, user agent, referring
    page and response status. The logs are used for delivery, security, abuse prevention and
    troubleshooting.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site does not receive or store those raw logs itself. Retention and access are controlled by
    the providers under their own policies.
  </p>

  <h2 id="advertising">Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    No advertising code, ad slots or ad networks are active on this site. No advertising cookies are
    set by this page.
  </p>
  <p>
    If advertising is added later, this policy will be updated before the code is deployed. Where
    consent is required, a consent mechanism will be added at the same time.
  </p>

  <h2 id="choices">Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can limit analytics by blocking third-party scripts, blocking the Histats domains, using
    your browser's private browsing mode, or clearing cookies after a visit. Because the site has no
    accounts, there is no profile to sign into or delete.
  </p>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete or object to the
    processing of personal data. Most of the information described here is aggregated traffic data
    held by Histats or by the hosting providers. Requests about that data should be directed to the
    relevant provider. For questions about this page, use the contact details below.
  </p>

  <h2 id="children">Children</h2>
  <p>
    This page is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect personal
    information from them. If you believe a child has submitted information through a service linked
    here, contact the provider of that service.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
  <p>
    This policy may be updated when the site changes, when a new service is added, or when the law
    requires it. The date at the top of the page shows the last revision. Material changes will be
    reflected here before the related feature goes live.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Site contact details are published on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. The address shown
    there is <a href={homeUrl}>{contact}</a>; selecting it returns to the homepage.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>